    "body": "> I think clearTargets should instead be based on event's path. You find the last tuple in event's path with a non-null target. And then if that tuple contains a node inside a shadow tree in one of the three target fields, you set clearTargets to true.\r\n\r\nI see. This sounds a reasonable change. Nice catch.",
